{"id": "EUVD-2026-86964", "enisaUuid": "f8295cb8-d03f-3482-9296-4d6c05383d43", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nntfs: leave HasEA flag untouched on setxattr failure\n\nIn ntfs_set_ea(), the exit path unconditionally updates the HasEA\nflag based on ea_info_qsize. When an error occurs before\nea_info_qsize is updated, NInoClearHasEA() hides existing on-disk\nEAs until the inode is evicted.\n\nOnly update the flag on success.", "datePublished": "2026-09-25T10:36:12", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:14:27", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5811a08310754cbf4a1122c81d14c54b8873c35c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ac727d86fb84bdc9626ba9c756c26767459f3083"], "aliases": ["GHSA-f7v2-w5q3-wjf8", "CVE-2026-98133"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.11, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "3e20c35f-38f1-3bfc-967f-e03774eb57a4", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7.1"}, {"id": "7d7c2513-01d5-3ba4-b70e-fab07daa2b6d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "9c0e413a-7bd3-3e7f-8af7-64a3efc5c7fe", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "fc053f05ca282a5e760b41f6560ac835c4e28037 <ac727d86fb84bdc9626ba9c756c26767459f3083"}, {"id": "cc23e119-2fec-39f2-9745-cf7eab8545d0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.7"}, {"id": "cc4e7e8a-b4a7-3955-a28a-47878725818e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "e586dcac-79fb-3594-a537-34021fc9bb73", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "fc053f05ca282a5e760b41f6560ac835c4e28037 <5811a08310754cbf4a1122c81d14c54b8873c35c"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "13f8a120-0a99-32fb-8910-84c985505b70", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}